WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.010
All data for Marcus Lithos
has been transferred.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.600
Beginning mask creation.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:48.900
Initiating.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.240
Successful.

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.920
<i>Mina Hiraya.
<i>You've been reborn as Aya Takagi.</i></i>

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.010
<i>You'll be in charge of Marcus Lithos.</i>

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.140
Understood.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.710
There's no issues with the Core Alma.
Chrysalises are tough.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.630
Their healing power is incredible.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.150
Nice to meet you.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:13.520
Erika?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.190
What are you doing here?

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:21.450
Erika? I'm your counselor, Aya Takagi.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:25.120
I've been put in charge of you.
Nice to meet you.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.370
Wait, you're not Erika?

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.910
Who's Erika? Do I really look like her?

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.710
I'm sorry. She's someone I know.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.800
You look... a lot like her, but...

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.100
Let's get our session started.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.940
You've only been through one battle
so far?

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:02.070
R-Right. I may not be cut out
for fighting and stuff.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:05.160
Everybody's like that at first.
Are you scared?

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:10.250
I am. And I still can't believe
what happened to Miki.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:14.500
Oh yeah! Where's Miki?
Is he still in cold sleep?

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.960
The Chrysalis Naoki Miki, right?

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.880
Yes, he should be.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:23.090
I see. Without him, I'm alone.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:27.260
Starting today, you have me.
You can talk to me about anything.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:33.310
I can't believe a weapon...
a weapon would change someone like that.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.320
I'm scared.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:43.570
When I think that, someday,
I'll become a busoma too...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.650
Don't worry.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:48.780
The Shoshidai will do anything
to prevent you from becoming a busoma.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.290
But we don't have a cure for it yet,
right?

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:55.500
If they don't make it in time,
I'll turn into a monster!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:57.790
Don't be upset.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.140
I'll do what I can to protect you.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.470
Why?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.560
Why won't they move?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.640
Marcus, stop!

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.610
I'll protect you.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:26.910
Erika.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:29.780
I'm sorry.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.290
It's okay. You can call me Erika.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:42.800
Where are we going?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.630
The Shoshidai.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.880
Didn't you not want to go back?

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.550
Did I say that?

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:54.890
Don't pout like that.
I'll tell you about the Shoshidai.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:07.650
So you see, Chrysalises are no different
than patients with an incurable disease.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:10.910
There's no medicine that can stop it,

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.830
and in the end, you don't just die,

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:18.080
the weapon's instincts take over,
and you lose yourself.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.670
Busoma are just pathetic monsters.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.210
You become a weapon.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.050
Like your Shiryu or my Chakram,

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:32.140
there are many weapons in the world
called Sage Alma that possess humans.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:37.480
Your Shiryu has externally crystalized,
which makes it a rare case, though.

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:43.230
The Shoshidai exists to gather and
preserve all the Sage Alma in the world.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.700
A facility where people like us,
those possessed by Sage Alma,

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:53.830
or Chrysalises, are isolated and
researched before being corrupted.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:57.160
Chrysalises who come here
are put into cold sleep.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.540
While we sleep, they work on a medicine.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.250
We sleep until that medicine is done.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.960
Year after year.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.020
Okay. Read that, Matoba.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.730
"Happiness always looks small
while you hold it in your hands,

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:26.690
but let go and you learn at once
how big and precious it is."

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.120
Matoba, did you live outside Japan?

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.540
No, I didn't.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:42.080
But I would often travel
when I helped my father with his work.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.500
So you can speak several languages?

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.710
-That's so cool!
-Wow!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.250
Helping your dad?

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:52.050
Well, I guess you could say
my job was philanthropy.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:55.300
Or maybe "charity" is an easier way
to put it.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.680
Wow!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.810
FACULTY ROOM

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.190
Excuse me.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.950
Oh, I'm sorry, Matoba.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.460
How do you say "sorry" in English?

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.750
You don't know how to say, "I'm sorry"?

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:26.080
Shut up.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.250
What do you want?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:32.050
Translate the phrase,
"Donate money to us."

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:33.880
Into 100 languages!

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:34.930
S-Stop it!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.890
The Japanese are accepting charity too!

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.060
You're...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.390
What is it, Ogata?

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:50.030
Teacher!
Nomura and his friends are misbehaving!

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:51.940
-Stop it, you idiot!
-Teacher!

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.030
Teacher, come quick!

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.990
Teacher! Over here!

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.080
-We're just joking.
-Please hurry!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.750
-Don't take it seriously!
-Teacher!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:06.960
I was so scared.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:09.670
Here.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.090
Thank you.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.090
You're a student here, huh?

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.630
Yeah. We're in the same class.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:17.800
I see.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.480
Thanks for your help yesterday.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:27.060
Sure. But today, you saved me.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:28.610
Are you okay?

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.400
It was nothing.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.400
But Ms. Ogata...

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.860
Do you remember the person
who saved us yesterday?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.450
Yes.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.870
Do you know him?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:44.370
Well, he's kind of like a little brother.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.120
I see. That's why he saved us!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.210
Can you tell me his name?

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.460
Gai. Gai Ogata.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.840
Gai Ogata.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.720
What were you thinking?

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:03.260
Don't be like that.
I was just a little late getting home.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.810
Stop messing around!

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:08.770
Your mission ended and you didn't return.
You ignored our messages.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:12.190
I finished my mission
and brought him as ordered.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:16.690
You agreed to be at the Shoshidai.
You can't do what you please.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.110
Right, right.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:19.820
Nice to meet you.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:24.160
Gai Ogata, I am Kyoka Kagami,
administrator of Shoshidai Branch Three.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.540
His Core Alma is the Shiryu,
a Japanese sword.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.340
Gai, thanks for coming.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.550
The Shoshidai welcomes you.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:39.590
But first...

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.560
Seiya Ichijo, you are ordered to report
for cold sleep immediately.

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:48.180
-What's wrong? You listening?
-No way.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.150
Your Maldicion readings are currently
at their limit.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:55.730
Any more combat will hasten
your transformation into a busoma.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.900
I ain't going back to sleep.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:00.860
Looks like you won't listen to reason.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:05.080
Don't get the wrong idea.
I still have work to do.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:08.710
I met Administrator Miura.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:14.170
I thought I'd met you before.
I remember now.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.420
You're Administrator Miura's daughter,
right?

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.090
Daddy, welcome home!

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.100
I'm back, Kyoka.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.270
I'll handle Miura.

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.610
Since we did a bunch of jobs together.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.320
It's the least I can do to repay him.

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:46.200
You want the same thing, right?

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.620
To save your father's soul.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:55.340
Give me permission to fight
Administrator Miura, no, Zsoltgewinn.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:59.840
I can't make that decision myself.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.020
Mommy!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.030
Kyoka Kagami, entering.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:31.370
So Seiya Ichijo wishes
to defeat Zsoltgewinn?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.370
Yes.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:36.330
Even the bearer of the Chakram
cannot defeat Zsoltgewinn.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.960
Have you forgotten?

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:42.760
A decade has passed since Administrator
Takuma Miura became Zsoltgewinn.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:45.930
How many Chrysalises have fallen to him?

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.300
But perhaps Seiya Ichijo...

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.140
There is no need.

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.680
We hadn't told you yet,

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:56.770
but the anti-busoma weapon
we've been building has been completed.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.440
We'll use it on Zsoltgewinn.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:01.110
Then the Prismaphon...

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:05.610
No, the Prismaphon is a new drug
that turns busoma back into humans.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:10.450
Even if it was ready,
we don't intend to use it on Zsoltgewinn.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.080
You understand, right?

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:16.460
Takuma Miura is a stain
on the history of the Shoshidai.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.290
Yes.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.140
It's always such a nasty sight.

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:35.350
These are all...

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:39.860
Yeah. Things the Shoshidai has searched
the whole world over for.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:42.150
You'll become a busoma too?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.490
You mean what we talked about?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:46.740
Yeah, probably at some point.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.660
But only a Chrysalis can defeat a busoma.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.370
To draw out your weapon's power
and win the battle,

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:56.460
you have to synchronize
with the Core Alma within you.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:01.290
The longer you're synchronized,
the closer you are to becoming a busoma.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.420
Cursed weapons that long
for blood and battle...

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:10.890
Don't tell me you want to be a busoma.

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:15.600
What are you thinking?

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:19.770
I told you before.
You stop being yourself.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.190
You lose your human heart.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:28.910
You're...

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.240
Thank you for your help before.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.490
Sure.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.410
You're here too, huh?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.250
Everyone here is so nice.
The Shoshidai is so wonderful!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.250
If we stay here,
we can return to being human!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.210
Marcus!

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:45.590
Come on, it's time for your next exam.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.420
That's right.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:48.550
See ya!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.680
Hurry!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.260
Does this next one hurt?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:54.010
-No, don't be scared.
-Is it really that great?

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.390
Bye, Sayaka!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:01.600
Wait. Are you going to club?

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:02.980
Yeah, why?

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.980
It's been a while. Maybe I'll go.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:07.150
That's rare. What's gotten into you?

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:11.160
Well, there's nothing waiting for me
at home.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.950
You always said you were busy
with something.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.160
That something is gone now.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.170
Listen up, everyone.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.680
Starting today, Matoba will join the club.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.250
I'm detecting a Maldicion field!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.090
It's Zsoltgewinn!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:15.390
Heavy infantry has engaged target!
Deploy special forces units!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.600
Boring.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.310
Is this all?

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.770
Interesting.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.110
Zsoltgewinn.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:12.070
What is this signal?
A busoma? No, a chrysalis?

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.030
Neither one.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.700
This is the anti-busoma weapon
HQ developed?

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.740
So they made these things?

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.370
So, did you ask your bosses?

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.000
Hey, you listening?

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:23.510
Seiya Ichijo.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:27.850
My father told me about you only once.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:32.400
He said you were a slacker,
but that you could be trusted.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.400
He understands me.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.900
I'll leave my father to you.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.780
You're sure?

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.950
I'm taking him.

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:47.160
I need an assistant.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:49.830
Fine.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.470
I'll be going.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.180
Goodbye.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:08.890
What's wrong?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.150
You're coming back, right Dad?

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:14.520
Of course.
It's just another business trip.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.070
I thought I'd never see you again.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:18.940
What are you talking about?

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:29.660
Promise... Promise you'll come back!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.260
Father.

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.040
This is awful.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:22.300
Yo, Mr. Miura. We meet again.

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:24.760
So they sent you?

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:29.180
Hey, do you remember the taste
of the sake we shared?

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:30.890
It was good, right?

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:36.610
The one called Miura is gone
from this body.

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:40.650
We'll drink together again...

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.320
in hell.
